<title>RUSSIA: Sixth Reuters ex-Moscow air cargo market.</title>
<headline>Sixth Reuters ex-Moscow air cargo market.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Moscow air cargo market rates in U.S. dollars per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to weight ratio of six-to-one:</p>
<p>						  Oct 18    Sept 19</p>
<p>					  EUROPE</p>
<p>     SVO(Moscow-Sheremetyevo)-FRA    1.07	1.12</p>
<p>     SVO-LON				  1.15	1.21</p>
<p>     SVO-LUX				  1.30	1.36</p>
<p>					  ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p>     SVO-BKK				  3.30	3.65</p>
<p>     SVO-SEL				  4.05	4.50</p>
<p>     SVO-NRT				  4.20	4.66</p>
<p>					  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>     SVO-DXB				  2.03	2.20</p>
<p>     SVO-SHJ				  2.40	2.58</p>
<p>					  UNITED STATES</p>
<p>     SVO-MIA				  3.35	3.52</p>
<p>     SVO-NYC				  2.63	2.94</p>
<p>     SVO-SFO				  3.24	3.60</p>
<p>* The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Moscow's Sheremetyevo international airport.</p>
<p>* All prices are quoted in U.S. dollars</p>
<p>* The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
